{"id":"n55112-1-8","stage":5,"title":"맵시 · 风采","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55112-1-8-1","ko":"이모가 처녀 적엔 맵시 있는 몸매 덕분에 남자한테 인기가 많았어.","zh":"姨妈我年轻没结婚时，身材好，很受男生欢迎呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이모가","meaning":"阿姨，姨妈","explanation":"이모：阿姨，姨妈；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이모","audio":"/audio/dfd6511ae5195e09a7c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71153","senseId":"1","lemma":"이모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이모가","audio":"/audio/dcbb897f73b7337ae5d4.mp3"}},{"text":"처녀","meaning":"处女","explanation":"처녀：处女。","readings":[{"term":"처녀","audio":"/audio/9efbc39a6a1e7ff89f8a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24929","senseId":"2","lemma":"처녀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"처녀","audio":"/audio/9efbc39a6a1e7ff89f8a.mp3"}},{"text":"적엔","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"적：时，时候；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"적","audio":"/audio/137f8ca799a5827448b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71232","senseId":"1","lemma":"적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"적엔","audio":"/audio/b00034c0280ead66db07.mp3"}},{"text":"맵시","meaning":"风采，风姿","explanation":"맵시：风采，风姿。","readings":[{"term":"맵시","audio":"/audio/d552fd0e358c1e7ebe40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55112","senseId":"1","lemma":"맵시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맵시","audio":"/audio/d552fd0e358c1e7ebe40.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"处于","explanation":"있다：处于；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"11","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"몸매","meaning":"身材，身姿","explanation":"몸매：身材，身姿。","readings":[{"term":"몸매","audio":"/audio/b65c87338bed307652f5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15301","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸매","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몸매","audio":"/audio/b65c87338bed307652f5.mp3"}},{"text":"덕분에","meaning":"托福，关怀，恩德","explanation":"덕분：托福，关怀，恩德；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"덕분","audio":"/audio/4863a9a8be42033e7d79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47410","senseId":"1","lemma":"덕분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"덕분에","audio":"/audio/b018e6ffb125d6c10a69.mp3"}},{"text":"남자한테","meaning":"男子，男人","explanation":"남자：男子，男人；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"1","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남자한테","audio":"/audio/2636c935f4d0dca23cf1.mp3"}},{"text":"인기가","meaning":"人气","explanation":"인기：人气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"인기","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70758","senseId":"1","lemma":"인기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인기가","audio":"/audio/2a8b53817ec38aa1eb97.mp3"}},{"text":"많았어.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많았어","audio":"/audio/cc7c795201337fc9bf26.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dfd6511ae5195e09","term":"이모","zh":"阿姨，姨妈","audio":"/audio/dfd6511ae5195e09a7c7.mp3","entryId":"71153","definition":"用于指称或称呼母亲的姐姐或妹妹。","pronunciation":["이모"]},{"id":"9efbc39a6a1e7ff8","term":"처녀","zh":"处女","audio":"/audio/9efbc39a6a1e7ff89f8a.mp3","entryId":"24929","definition":"没跟男性发生过性关系的女性。","pronunciation":["처ː녀"]},{"id":"137f8ca799a58274","term":"적","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/137f8ca799a5827448b3.mp3","entryId":"71232","definition":"进行某事或出现其状态的时候；或过去某个时间。","pronunciation":["적"]},{"id":"d552fd0e358c1e7e","term":"맵시","zh":"风采，风姿","audio":"/audio/d552fd0e358c1e7ebe40.mp3","entryId":"55112","definition":"精心修饰衣着或仪表，看上去很漂亮。","pronunciation":["맵씨"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"处于","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"处在某种状态、水平或阶段等。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"b65c87338bed3076","term":"몸매","zh":"身材，身姿","audio":"/audio/b65c87338bed307652f5.mp3","entryId":"15301","definition":"身体整体的样子。","pronunciation":["몸매"]},{"id":"4863a9a8be42033e","term":"덕분","zh":"托福，关怀，恩德","audio":"/audio/4863a9a8be42033e7d79.mp3","entryId":"47410","definition":"某人给予的关照或帮助；或某事发生后带来的好处。","pronunciation":["덕뿐"]},{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男子，男人","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"作为男性出生的人。","pronunciation":["남자"]},{"id":"97bd6aed2c720b21","term":"인기","zh":"人气","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3","entryId":"70758","definition":"许多人对某个对象的浓厚兴趣或喜爱之心。","pronunciation":["인끼"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/a890cc26cd8ebe564245.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55112-1-8-2","ko":"지금도 이모 몸매는 예뻐요.","zh":"姨妈，您现在身材也很好呀。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금도","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금도","audio":"/audio/a2aac7f6c89a0d90e412.mp3"}},{"text":"이모","meaning":"阿姨，姨妈","explanation":"이모：阿姨，姨妈。","readings":[{"term":"이모","audio":"/audio/dfd6511ae5195e09a7c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71153","senseId":"1","lemma":"이모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이모","audio":"/audio/dfd6511ae5195e09a7c7.mp3"}},{"text":"몸매는","meaning":"身材，身姿","explanation":"몸매：身材，身姿；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"몸매","audio":"/a